:"子貢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003869","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m044-0276","start":276,"end":278,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003904","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m044-0283","start":283,"end":285,"surface":"越王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003905","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m044-0288","start":288,"end":290,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003904","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples","book_id":"b-shiji-067","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-067-disciples"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p046","text":"子貢去而之魯。吳王果與齊人戰於艾陵，大破齊師，獲七將軍之兵而不歸，果以兵臨晉，與晉人相遇黃池之上。吳晉爭彊。晉人擊之，大敗吳師。越王聞之，涉江襲吳，去城七里而軍。吳王聞之，去晉而歸，與越戰於五湖。三戰不勝，城門不守，越遂圍王宮，殺夫差而戮其相。破吳三年，東向而霸。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m046-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"子貢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003869","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m046-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003904","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m046-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"齊人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、氏族、未名者或未定指代；不補姓名、成員或官職持有人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m046-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"七將軍","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、氏族、未名者或未定指代；不補姓名、成員或官職持有人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m046-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"晉人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、氏族、未名者或未定指代；不補姓名、成員或官職持有人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m046-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"晉人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、氏族、未名者或未定指代；不補姓名、成員或官職持有人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m046-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":